\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Harvest rate comparison in Basilisk. (a)~Mean harvest rate with standard deviation error bars and overlaid individual episode data points. Statistical significance confirmed via Welch's t-test ($p < 0.001$). (b)~Violin plot with embedded box plots showing distributional shape; individual episodes shown as jittered points. The Bee\_Fi HRL policy exhibits a tighter, higher-centered distribution.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:harvest_comparison}{{2}{6}{Harvest rate comparison in Basilisk. (a)~Mean harvest rate with standard deviation error bars and overlaid individual episode data points. Statistical significance confirmed via Welch's t-test ($p < 0.001$). (b)~Violin plot with embedded box plots showing distributional shape; individual episodes shown as jittered points. The Bee\_Fi HRL policy exhibits a tighter, higher-centered distribution}{figure.2}{}}
